msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Do you know of a man named Minamida? He's actually calling himself \"Doctor "
"Minamida.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "I see. Well, don't worry about it, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"But if you ever do come across a man named Minamida, please be extra "
"careful. That's all I can say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "648"
msgid "I thought you might have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "What about him? He's... an acquaintance of mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"What? Hmm, maybe that's a different Minamida, then. Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"Just in case he is the same person, though, be extra careful around him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"Do you know of a man named Minamida? He's actually calling himself \"Doctor "
"Minamida.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Oh, you do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "What about him?"
msgstr "E lui?"

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"While we were collecting information on the hitmen, the name \"Minamida\" "
"came up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "You mean Minamida is one of the hitmen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Well, no, but..."
msgstr "Beh no, ma..."

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Come on. What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"We came across his name while we were hunting for information on a "
"mysterious man named Amon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"This \"Amon\" seems to be a hitman himself. He apparently works for some "
"mysterious organization, and people say that if he targets you, you're as "
"good as dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"Actually, before we found out Arase-san was the man behind the Reapers, we "
"thought Amon was their ringleader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"We keep running into walls. Minamida is the only solid lead we could get. He"
" was the president of a video game company that went bankrupt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "So how is Minamida connected to Amon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"We're not sure, but based on the information we've gathered, it seems you've"
" become one of Amon's targets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid ""
"We're certain Minamida is linked to Amon, so if he's a friend of yours, "
"please be very careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"(Could the Minamida I know be linked to Amon? It sounds crazy, but Ibuki's "
"info seems solid.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"(Still, Minamida hasn't been acting strangely. I'll just have to see how "
"things turn out...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "We appreciate everything you've done. Thanks to you, the HLA is safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "I'll do my best to carry on Kashiwagi-san's legacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid ""
"I know you have an awful lot on your plate, so take care of yourself, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "We just got in some new info on a hitman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Ibuki-san! We got trouble!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "Cosa succede?"

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "There's a man making a big scene in front of the restaurant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "He keeps yelling for the HLA to come out. The guy's really on edge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid ""
"Somebody who knows where HLA Headquarters is and who's making a big racket, "
"eh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "Sounds like one of the Reaper hitmen. Let's go check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid ""
"It looks like Batsu is calming down. Right now, he's talking to some HLA "
"members in the back room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid "Just leave him to us."
msgstr "Lascia che me ne occupi io."

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1248"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid ""
"Kotaro wants to rehabilitate back into society. For the time being, we can "
"put him to work here as an assistant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid "But, first, he's got a lot to learn about manners..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1308"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320"
msgid "You got <Color:8>70,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai intascato <Color:8>80.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1332"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1344"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid "So it was just a disguise, huh...? I had no idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid "I hope we can help them figure out what they'd like to do from now on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid "You got <Color:8>90,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai intascato <Color:8>80.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1416"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1440"
msgid ""
"So Shu was at the Millennium Tower, huh? He couldn't possibly have hit "
"anybody from way up there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1452"
msgid ""
"He's an earnest fellow. I think he'll come to understand us once he's heard "
"us out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1476"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1488"
msgid "You got <Color:8>90,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai intascato <Color:8>80.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1500"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1512"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1524"
msgid "The HLA will provide Hasutani's children with financial assistance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1536"
msgid ""
"We'd like to help him find some decent work and get him back to living with "
"his children as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1548"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1572"
msgid "You got <Color:8>80,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai intascato <Color:8>80.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1584"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1596"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1608"
msgid ""
"We asked Kurenai all kinds of questions, but it seems he really doesn't know"
" that much about the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620"
msgid ""
"The Reapers are an organization that probably has a lot of rank-and-file "
"members like him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632"
msgid ""
"To get to the guys at the very top, we're going to have to catch people in "
"leadership positions..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1644"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1656"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1668"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>100.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1680"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704"
msgid "I'm sorry for all the trouble my men put you through today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1716"
msgid ""
"I'll make sure our members understand we're being targeted by the Reapers "
"and have them take it to heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1728"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1740"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1752"
msgid "You got <Color:8>120,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>20.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1764"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1788"
msgid ""
"We thought we were looking for a masked man, but I guess we were completely "
"wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1800"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1812"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1824"
msgid "You got <Color:8>120,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>20.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1836"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1848"
msgid "Thank you for helping us with our sudden \"visitor.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1860"
msgid ""
"I guess it turned out for the best that he came to find us, seeing as we "
"didn't have any info on his whereabouts yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1872"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1884"
msgid "You got <Color:8>150,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>150.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1896"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1920"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1932"
msgid "It seems Lorentz really was just curious about the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1944"
msgid ""
"Even general information about the clan, like the number of members and the "
"names of the leaders, seemed to really make him happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1956"
msgid ""
"On the other hand, when I asked him about the Reapers, he didn't know "
"anything about the top leaders. Same as the other hitmen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1968"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1980"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1992"
msgid "You got <Color:8>130,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>30.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "2004"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2016"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2028"
msgid ""
"Samejima isn't a hitman, but his weapons supply network seems to be quite "
"extensive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2040"
msgid ""
"I think stopping his supply of weapons to the Reapers will have a big "
"impact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2052"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2064"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2076"
msgid "You got <Color:8>140,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>40.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "2088"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2100"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2112"
msgid "It seems Yuto already knew Kotaro, who we've got working here now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2124"
msgid ""
"Since they're both still young, I hope they'll apply themselves as friendly "
"rivals and steer each other in the right direction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2136"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2148"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2160"
msgid "You got <Color:8>180,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai intascato <Color:8>80.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "2172"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2196"
msgid "Great work. I'm glad you're okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2208"
msgid ""
"We believe Gohren knows a great deal about the Reapers, but he's refusing to"
" tell us anything at the moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2220"
msgid ""
"We won't use force to get him to talk, though. That's not the way we do "
"things around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2232"
msgid ""
"We like to take the time to talk matters over. I'm sure we can arrive at a "
"mutual understanding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2244"
msgid "Kiryu-san, well done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2256"
msgid "Here is your reward. We appreciate your hard work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2268"
msgid "You got <Color:8>200,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>200.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "2280"
msgid "Please come back again. We're really counting on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2292"
msgid "Thank you for your hard work, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2304"
msgid "Sorry I let him get away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2316"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about it. Just getting a lead to his boss is a big step forward "
"for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2328"
msgid ""
"He said he'd contact us, but do you really think he'll go through with it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2340"
msgid ""
"You're an obstacle in the Reapers' path. I'm sure they'll be getting in "
"touch one way or another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2352"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "Immagino di sì."

msgctxt "2364"
msgid "Here is your reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2376"
msgid "No, I can't accept this. Not when I couldn't catch him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2388"
msgid ""
"Take it, Kiryu-san. It wouldn't be right if we didn't at least cover "
"expenses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2400"
msgid ""
"We want to make sure you're prepared for the next battle anyway. Their "
"ringleader is not to be underestimated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2412"
msgid "Please make sure you're fully prepared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2424"
msgid "...Yeah, all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2436"
msgid "You got <Color:8>250,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "2448"
msgid "Anyway, sit tight for now. We need to be prepared on our end, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2460"
msgid "And, Kiryu-san... You be extra careful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2472"
msgid "That's it."
msgstr "Tutto qui."

msgctxt "2484"
msgid ""
"Our battle with the Reapers is finally over. I really want to thank you, "
"Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2496"
msgid ""
"You don't need to thank me. It was the least I could do to honor Kashiwagi-"
"san's memory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2508"
msgid "I'll continue the work of the HLA to honor Kashiwagi-san's dying wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2520"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "2532"
msgid ""
"If you ever need anything⑬anything at all, from money to relationship "
"advice⑬please come see us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2544"
msgid "Let's see... I'm good for right now, I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2556"
msgid "In any case, take this as a token of our sincere gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2568"
msgid "You got <Color:8>300,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>30.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "2580"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Muramasa Blade<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto una <Color:8>Lama Muramasa<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "2604"
msgid "Good luck with everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2616"
msgid "You, too, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Pure tu, Kiryu-san!"

msgctxt "2628"
msgid "Until next time, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2640"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "2712"
msgid ""
"Take it, Kiryu-san. It wouldn't be right if we didn't at least cover "
"expenses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2724"
msgid ""
"We're tracking down another hitman right now. Would you like to see the "
"information we have?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2736"
msgid "All right then. Feel free to call on me anytime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2748"
msgid ""
"This is the information we have on the hitman we're tracking down right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2772"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "Buona fortuna."

msgctxt "2784"
msgid "Good work, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2796"
msgid "What would you like to do now?"
msgstr "Cosa vuoi fare adesso?"

msgctxt "2808"
msgid "All right then. Feel free to call on me anytime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2820"
msgid ""
"You can accept a request for a hitman mission you would like to do from the "
"HLA in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2832"
msgid ""
"If you select \"View Requests\" when talking to Ibuki, a list of the "
"requests you can accept at that time will be displayed. Press "
"<Action:Button_Cross@UI> at the View Requests screen to see an investigative"
" report on a particular hitman. To accept a request, select the \"Accept "
"this Request\" command."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2844"
msgid ""
"You can only accept one request for a hitman mission at a time. Once you "
"have accepted a request, you cannot cancel it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2856"
msgid ""
"Items on the list marked \"Done\" indicate missions that have already been "
"completed. You can view the mission currently underway as well as previously"
" completed missions by selecting \"Substories\" from the Pause Menu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2868"
msgid "This is all the hitman information we've managed to gather."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2904"
msgid "Thank you, Kiryu-san. We'll do everything in our power to assist you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2916"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "Buona fortuna."

